development.question_text:
For the chosen base, decide whether $x$, $y$ or neither is the perpendicular height.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);\coordinate (B) at (4.6,0);\coordinate (C) at (6,2.6);\coordinate (D) at (1.4,2.6);
\draw (A)--(B) node[midway,below] {base};\draw (B)--(C) node[midway,right] {$x$};\draw (C)--(D);\draw (D)--(A) node[midway,left] {$y$};
